   2:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** //
   3:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // Parses the ICO container, then delegates to the PNG decoder for
   4:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // PNG-compressed entries or a small embedded-BMP reader for classic DIB
   5:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // entries. Classic icons store their DIB height doubled (image + trailing
   6:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // 1bpp AND mask); rows are bottom-up for a positive height. AND-mask bits
   7:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // set to 1 are fully transparent (composited over white), matching
   8:Source/render/decoders/ico.c **** // Chromium's ICO handling.
